title: SAP ASE (Sybase): Database Data Usage
agents: linux
catalog: app/sybase
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check monitors the used space of the data segments of an SAP ASE
 (Sybase) database, reported by the agent plug-in {check_sybase}. Data
 segments are all segments except dedicated log segments, so on databases
 with data and log on the same device, the log is included.

 Levels for the used space in percent (default: 90% WARN, 95% CRIT) and
 optionally for the absolute free space can be configured via the rule
 "SAP ASE (Sybase) Database Data Usage", per host and per database.

item:
 The SID of the ASE instance and the database name, separated by a space.

discovery:
 One service is created for each database with a data size above 0.
